  "notes": "Auckland also normally hosts a separate Autumn edition (most recently Anzac weekend, Apr 25-27, 2026 — already past); no 2027 Auckland Autumn date is announced on the site yet, so only the confirmed Spring edition is listed here. All 36 guest picks come from the shared /guests/ page; every card there is explicitly tagged 'Appearing in person at Auckland Spring' (none yet for Wellington or Christchurch) but shows no other bio text beyond the name, so known-for is left blank for all of them; cat is assigned from general knowledge of each named guest. No og/twitter image exists on the page and no edition-specific key art was found among the hero images, so the cover uses the Armageddon Expo brand logo. Armageddon also runs a Palmerston North edition (new addition, not in this research batch). 2026-10-08 refresh: added Brandon Routh (new card tagged 'Appearing in person at Auckland Spring') and removed Giancarlo Esposito, whose card is gone from the guests page in today's render."
